I don't think one should be able to recharge magic lamps.
Recharging these lamps is illogic, since the "charge" is in fact
a djinny (SP?), that is released when the lamp is rubbed. Since
the djinny gives you a wish, and not the lamp, a magic lamp should
be one-use only.

Anyone care to comment?

